{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26085","headline":"寄宋申锡评事时从李少师移军回归 · 鲍溶","name":"寄宋申锡评事时从李少师移军回归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君逐元侯静虏归，虎旗龙节驻春晖。\n欲求岱岳燔柴礼，已锡鲁人缝掖衣。\n长劒一时天外倚，五云多遶日边飞。\n心期共贺太平世，去去故乡亲食薇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}